      },
      "correct": "c",
      "explication": "Avec $u=x-3$ : $\\sin(\\pi x)=\\sin(\\pi u+3\\pi)=-\\sin(\\pi u)\\approx-\\pi u$, d'où $s\\to-1/\\pi$."
    },
    {
