      "correct": "d",
      "explication": "$x^2-2x+4=(x-1)^2+3$ ; avec $u=x-1$, $A=\\int_0^1\\frac{du}{(u^2+3)^{3/2}}=\\left[\\frac{u}{3\\sqrt{u^2+3}}\\right]_0^1=\\frac{1}{6}$."
